flowchart LR
    OSM[OpenStreetMap] --> DL[Download]
    HIFLD[HIFLD lines] --> DL
    FEMA[FEMA flood zones] --> DL
    DL --> FT[Convert to feet]
    FT --> DB[(PostGIS)]
    DB --> LOC[Location check]
    DB --> CON[Connectivity check]
    DB --> ATT[Attribute check]
    LOC --> ERR[Errors]
    CON --> ERR
    ATT --> ERR
    ERR --> RANK[Rank by flood zone]
    RANK --> CSV[Error report]
    RANK --> MAP[QA map]
